<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>They serve as proof of goods being transported and the tax liability associated with the transportation.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Packers and movers in Patna التأكد من الحصول على GST e-Way Bills for all inter-state moves between Patna and Sasaram.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>These bills must be generated online through the GST Portal and must accompany the consignment during transportation.</span></li></ul>

<p>To ensure compliance and credibility, reputable packers and movers companies in Patna offer IBA (Indian Bankers' Association)-approved lorry receipts (LR/Bilty). These are official documents that confirm the transportation of goods from Patna to Sasaram. These LR/Bilty act as proof of the consignment being transported and provide a sense of security due to their IBA endorsement.</p>

<p>To address potential risks during transportation, packers and movers companies provide comprehensive IRDAI (Insurance Regulatory and Development Authority of India) marine transit insurance.</p>

